  "goodToKnow": "Kramen means to rummage around: in der Tasche kramen, nach dem Schlüssel kramen. It comes from der Kram (stuff, junk), as in Mach deinen Kram selbst (do your own thing) or Ich hab den ganzen Kram satt. Add heraus- for kramen out: Er kramte ein Foto hervor. Dated der Krämer was a small shopkeeper, and der Krämerladen a small corner shop. Rummaging is also called wühlen."
